# `@ v` places nothing, so it fits a blueprint of any row: a module that emits `Ui.*`
# gives `@ 3` where a blueprint of another row is wanted. Found by the step 3 build on the
# library (`^Document`'s `@Query` default, row `Lower d`, written in a module of another).
# Written by Claude on the claude-self-hosting branch; subject to change.
module PureBlueprint
emit Ui.*

family Quiet

@Given: fn Nat -> @Nat emit Quiet.*
fn @Given n = @ n
